# SmartSpectra API key — register free at https://physiology.presagetech.com/auth/register
# The main process reads this; it is never exposed to the renderer (see app/preload).
# Copy this file to .env — the main process loads it at startup, in development.
#
# Quote the value if it contains a #, like KEY="ab#cd". Unquoted, a # starts a
# comment and the rest of the value is dropped silently, which looks like a key
# the SDK simply rejects.
SMARTSPECTRA_API_KEY=

# Optional. Set to anything non-empty to print how long the camera takes to
# close after each capture:
#
#   [capture] camera release: released in 340ms
#
# That number is what DEVICE_RELEASE_TIMEOUT_MS in app/main/release.ts is
# guessing at, and #63 is where it gets settled. A release that failed or
# outran the wait prints whether or not this is set, because a camera that did
# not close is what the next capture blames on another program having it.
KINVUE_LOG_CAPTURE=
